ERROR:  column "keyy" does not exist
LINE 1: ...nsertconflicttest values (1, 'Apple') on conflict (keyy) do ...
                                                             ^
HINT:  Perhaps you meant to reference the column "insertconflicttest.key" or the column "excluded.key".
